# D3-LI-007: A sunscreen model has spectral bands, not one universal shield factor
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
new
new
add v1 sunscreen 1g
add v2 sunscreen 1g
add v3 sunscreen 1g
add v4 water 1g
irradiate v1 305nm 1W/m2
irradiate v2 365nm 1W/m2
irradiate v3 550nm 1W/m2
irradiate v4 305nm 1W/m2
look v1
look v2
look v3
look v4
inspect
